44645	44742	44147	44148	his companion	395	“ Oh , the obvious consolation . Taking some one else ’s admirer when one loses one ’s own . In good society that always whitewashes a woman . But really , Dorian , how different Sibyl Vane must have been from all the women one meets ! There is something to me quite beautiful about her death . I am glad I am living in a century when such wonders happen . They make one believe in the reality of the things we all play with , such as romance , passion , and love . ”
